<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 200 bln lire Eurobond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 200 bln lire Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Cariplo and Bear Stearns.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN ITL   COUPON     7.15	MATURITY    13.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.60    PAY DATE    13.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1	 DENOMS (M) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC   1.375</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
